 complete, switching to visual polish.", "session_chain": null, "cwd_mismatch": "CWD is /Users/davidcruwys/dev/ad/brains (the brains monorepo root). All file edits target /Users/davidcruwys/dev/ad/appydave.com/apps/web/ \u2014 a completely different project. The inferred project from file touches is appydave.com, confirmed by 12 edit files and 5 write files all under that path. Brains was where the terminal happened to be.", "skill_gap": "David expected Claude to use the AppyStack brand recipe for color palette decisions. Despite 4 Skill invocations and 7 ToolSearch calls, Claude's initial color choices ignored the recipe. David had to explicitly correct: 'Still don't feel like you're using the recipe because you haven't picked any of the colour benefits.' The recipe is available via AppyStack template skills but Claude's application was superficial \u2014 it may have found the recipe but not extracted actionable color values.", "O06_autonomy_profile": "guided (ratio=6.7): user steers regularly", "O07_machine_character": "m4-mini: always-on workhorse, handles most sessions"}, "analysis": {"wave": "W6-f1ee6fea", "findings_file": "findings-w6-heavy-2.md", "analysed_at": "2026-03-22T14:00:00Z"}, "registry_type": "BUILD", "proposed_subtypes": ["build.iterative_design"], "skills_invoked": [], "disposition": "active", "interest_level": "high", "notes": "BUILD correct but CWD brains/ is incidental \u2014 actual project is appydave.com. Digital Stage Summit landing page: full lifecycle from project discovery to deploy in 79min. 3 frustration events (Chrome conflict, premature push, brand recipe ignored). Densest session: 283 events in 79min. 4 subagents used for exploration.", "derived": {"autonomy_ratio": {"value": 6.74, "bucket": "guided"}, "session_liveness": {"value": 0.632, "bucket": "intermittent"}}, "backward_pass": {"batch": "bp-batch-04", "pass_date": "2026-03-23", "new_predicates": ["P17", "P18", "P19", "P20", "P21", "P22"], "new_classifiers": ["C08", "C09", "C10"