tion, Playwright for live app verification \u2014 characteristic of iterative data validation and merge conflict resolution"}, "project_attribution": {"value": "reliable", "confidence": "high", "reasoning": "CWD is signal-studio, all Bash/Read/Write/Edit targets signal-studio data and code files"}, "session_scale": {"value": "heavy", "confidence": "high", "reasoning": "119 events, 81 active minutes, 202 total minutes with one 61-min idle gap"}, "C08_delegation_style": {"value": "conversational", "confidence": "medium"}, "C09_session_continuity": {"value": "fresh", "confidence": "medium"}, "C10_output_type": {"value": "code_changes", "confidence": "high"}, "C11_initiation_source": {"value": "voice_dictated", "confidence": "medium"}}, "predicates": {"is_feature_construction": {"result": false, "justification": "No new routes, components or product features \u2014 data manipulation, schema design discussion, and seed data editing only"}, "has_frustration_signals": {"result": true, "justification": "Prompt 25: 'I don't know what the fuck canonical actually means, to be honest' \u2014 explicit profanity indicating frustration with terminology; broader confusion about data tier naming throughout"}, "is_multi_phase": {"result": true, "justification": "Phase 1: Cold start + state of play; Phase 2: Angela's data merge strategy discussion; Phase 3: 3-tier data design (test/seed/production); Phase 4: Data conflict resolution (Michael Chen, Angel Corp); Phase 5: Write prompt for Angela; Phase 6: Pull Angela's data and resolve merge conflicts; Phase 7 (after 61-min gap): git push safety discussion + context exhaustion"}, "has_brain_file_writes": {"result": false, "justification": "No brain directory files written"}, "has_playwright_calls": {"result": true, "justification": "7 Playwright events: browser_navigate(2), browser_click(4), browser_snapshot(1) \u2014 used to verify the live app after data changes"}, "has_cross_session_refs": {"result": false, "justification": "No direct